+# alertmanager-k8s
+
+A Kubernetes charm for Prometheus Alertmanager, written with the `ops`
+library. The charm source is in `src/` (`charm.py` for the Juju side,
+`alertmanager.py` for the workload and its Pebble layer, `config_builder.py`
+for rendering `alertmanager.yml`), unit tests (ops.testing / Scenario) in
+`tests/unit/`, integration tests in `tests/integration/`. Charm libraries
+fetched with `charmcraft fetch-lib` live under `lib/`.
+
+## Commands
+
+- Unit tests: `tox -e unit` (or `JUJU_VERSION=3.0.3 PYTHONPATH=.:lib:src uv run --extra dev pytest tests/unit`)
+- Lint: `tox -e lint`
+- Charm linter: `uvx charmlint .`
